# Goal: commit validation, including empty-message error precedence.
I prelude1.inc
> commit ""
Please enter a commit message.
<<<
> commit "Nothing here"
No changes added to the commit.
<<<
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit ""
Please enter a commit message.
<<<
= f.txt wug.txt
> commit "track f after rejected empty message"
<<<
> commit "Nothing here"
No changes added to the commit.
<<<
